OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over Chief Constable
OL,4,Aappointment process
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police and Crime Commissioner (PCC)
OL,7,Ffor Warwickshire is facing questions
OL,8,Fover the process to recruit a new Chief
OL,9,FConstable for the force, after the
OL,10,Fpreferred candidate status was
OL,11,Fwithdrawn from a named candidate.
OL,13,FEmma Bond MBE, who is currently the
OL,14,FAssistant Chief Constable at Police
OL,15,FScotland, was named in May 2026 as the
OL,16,Fperson who, subject to vetting, would
OL,17,Freplace Alex Franklin-Smith, following
OL,18,Fhis retirement in April 2026.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35302
