OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1794394579
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over Chief Constable
OL,4,Aappointment process
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, more than four months after the
OL,7,FPCC named Bond as their preferred
OL,8,Fcandidate, the PCC announced that
OL,9,Fstatus had been withdrawn, effectively
OL,10,Fmeaning the job offer no longer exists.
OL,12,FIn a statement, Philip Seccombe, the
OL,13,Fcurrent Warwickshire PCC, said no
OL,14,Ffurther statements would be made.
